# Cortex Cloud Issues Exporter (Commit 1)

## Install

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Configure

Copy `config.example.json` to `config.json` and fill in your values.

## Run

```bash
python get_issues.py --config config.json
```

This initial scaffold authenticates, reads the configuration, prepares pagination,
and prints where requests will be sent. The next iteration will implement the
full export loop and CSV streaming.
